WEBVTT

00:04:59.156 --> 00:05:02.676
and it wouldn't touch,
as it didn't, men's labor.

00:05:03.156 --> 00:05:04.356
And they did it.

00:05:04.396 --> 00:05:08.516
Now, other nations across the globe,
the UK, other you know,

00:05:08.516 --> 00:05:09.956
they didn't close the schools.

00:05:09.996 --> 00:05:12.596
They approached it
from a different perspective, right?

00:05:12.636 --> 00:05:14.556
Or if they closed schools,

00:05:14.556 --> 00:05:16.116
they had a plan

00:05:16.156 --> 00:05:19.436
on what they were going to do
to support women, to bring them back.

00:05:19.476 --> 00:05:22.596
And so, school closures were part
of this Marshall Plan for Moms.

00:05:22.636 --> 00:05:23.756
Retraining.

00:05:23.796 --> 00:05:25.516
Many women found themselves in jobs

00:05:25.516 --> 00:05:27.556
that were automated
because of the pandemic

00:05:27.596 --> 00:05:29.556
and jobs that weren't going to come back.

00:05:29.596 --> 00:05:31.556
And so what was the plan to do retraining